                                "sense_id": "77523043-f380-3305-b679-28393a4b044b",
                                "text": "And at a bar in Dolores I met a lady, a very tanked lady, who introduced herself as Miss E. X. Love. How delicious the lies we told!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "745b7ec6-1ed6-48bd-bedf-33316ddb3469",
                                "sense_id": "77523043-f380-3305-b679-28393a4b044b",
                                "text": "[…] and mingled some and then he started buying shots. We did a lot or at least I did. We got into a serious conversation about my troubles. I told him the whole story. After getting very tanked I realized the place had become empty."
                            }
                        ]
